{"availability":"available","full":"AtulACleaver/SkillGraph","name":"SkillGraph","description":"Type your skills, pick a target role, and see how ready you are, which roles fit, and what to learn next. Built from 12,872 Indian tech job postings using association rule mining (Apriori, FP-growth) and a calibrated classifier. FastAPI + React on Vercel.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-25T11:33:15Z","updated":"2026-10-11T17:44:44Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://skillgraph-exp.vercel.app/","topics":["apriori","association-rules","classification","data-mining","fastapi","fp-growth","india","job-market","react","vercel"],"demo":"https://skillgraph-exp.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:58.602Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:58.602Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:58.602Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:58.602Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SkillGraph maps applicant skill profiles to Indian technology roles, predicts readiness with qualitative bands, and recommends prioritized skill additions with co-occurrence companions. The system is built from 12,872 labelled Indian tech job postings, association rule mining with FP-growth, and a calibrated logistic regression classifier."],"features":["Readiness scoring with qualitative bands: Probability outputs pair with role top-20 skill coverage to place applicants in Ready, Close, or Not yet.","Top 3 role family matches: Softmax probabilities rank the closest career tracks from 10 calibrated role distributions.","Ranked skill gap recommendations: Counterfactual probability gains multiplied by empirical posting frequency identify the top 5 skills to learn next.","Companion skill discovery: Mined association rules surface co-occurring tools at lift >= 1.50 for combined learning.","Fast autocomplete over aliases: Prefix search indexes 800 c